# /draft-outreach

Generalizes Topwater's `/draft-outreach` and `/draft-email`. Produces a
personalized outreach draft for each cleared {{vocabulary.entity}} — and
only ever a draft.

---

## Before anything — reuse check (Rule O4)

Unit of reuse: the {{vocabulary.entity}}. Check
`outputs/_ledgers/comms-drafts.json` (per
`standards/OUTPUT-STANDARDS.md` Rule O1's ledger section) for every
{{vocabulary.entity}} that already has a draft — an existing draft is
copied forward byte for byte, never rewritten, unless the person explicitly
asks for a redo. This ledger check is what makes reruns of this skill safe:
without it, a rerun over the same batch would create a second draft for
every {{vocabulary.entity}} already drafted.

## Gate — must have cleared `/check-crm-history`

Never draft outreach for a {{vocabulary.entity}} that hasn't been run
through `/check-crm-history` and come back cleared. This is a hard
precondition, not a suggestion — check for that skill's output before
doing any drafting work.
